{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-e32ae70aaccfc4f8ba17e6a6a617bc0b05da132161460d8a","family_id":"KR:006574","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Enforcement Rules of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act","title_original":"교통ㆍ에너지ㆍ환경세법 시행규칙","kind":"기획재정부령","source_version":"270243","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=270243","source_sha256":"99129fa87198dde7d65113cb7db1fbce6f402e0eebdd4849d79cfbe3f5e1d12e","body_sha256":"07e9f6496ac36e13c4bb00112db5468b0a83ea8b4ee50e40109ad5d7ae3d1363","article_count":0,"full_text":"■ Enforcement Rules of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act [Attached Form No. 13] <Amended on May 26, 2014>\n\nReport of Sales of Petroleum Products for Diplomatic Missions and Application for Credit (Refund) of Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax\n\n| Receipt number | Date of receipt | Date of processing | Processing period: 5 days |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| | | | |\n\nApplicant\n\n| Name (representative) | Business registration number |\n|---|---|\n| | |\n| Business name (corporate name) | |\n| | |\n| Address (location of head office) | Telephone number |\n| | |\n| Location of manufacturing place | |\n| | |\n\nDetails of Application\n\n<table>\n<tr><th>Type of petroleum product</th><th>Seller</th><th>Date of sale</th><th>Quantity</th><th>Unit price</th><th>Amount</th><th>Tax amount for credit (refund)</th><th>Name of diplomatic mission</th><th>Date of issue and serial number of recommendation</th></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</table>\n\nHaving sold petroleum products for diplomatic missions as stated above, I report the sales pursuant to Article 20 (3) of the Enforcement Decree of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act and request a credit (refund) of traffic, energy and environment tax.\n\nYear ____ Month ____ Day ____\nApplicant: ____________________ (Signature or seal)\n\nTo the Head of the Tax Office\n\nAttachment: Recommendation for the Purchase of Tax-Exempt Petroleum Products.\nFee: None.\n\nProcessing Procedure\n\n| Step | Procedure | Actor printed in the form |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Prepare application | Applicant |\n| 2 | Receive application | Department in charge of taxpayer support |\n| 3 | Investigate and verify | Department in charge of tax-base management |\n| 4 | Decide and implement | |\n\nThe four boxes are connected in sequence by three arrows pointing to the right.\n\n210 mm × 297 mm [White paper, 80 g/m², or medium-grade paper, 80 g/m²]\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_source_review_evidence":[{"evidence":{"exact_author_input":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\aut